## 1. TUI run extracts the embedded native library into TMPDIR (contract §1: no writes outside named paths)
tui exit=0 rendered=true
-rw-------  1 amanthanvi  wheel  5560064 Oct  2 20:31 .bun-501-33eea43aef98a673.dylib
## 2. Same-size, same-uid planted file at the predictable name is loaded without content verification
tui exit=1 rendered=false
file after run is still all zeros: yes
## 3. Different-size planted file is replaced (rewritten) and the TUI works
tui exit=0 rendered=true
size after run: 5560064
## 4. Sidecar library via OTUI_ASSET_ROOT: no TMPDIR extraction (also shows the env var is honored when inherited)
tui exit=0 rendered=true
TMPDIR empty
## 5. BUN_BE_BUN=1 turns the shipped binary into a general Bun runtime
BUN_BE_BUN: evaluated arbitrary code
exit=0
